This study was carried out in coordination with an independent transportation consulting firm, utilizing economists, geographers, and other acamedicians. The cities were chosen on the basis of size and geographic location, so that cities from all sections of the country and from each category in the proposed population-mileage formula would be represented in the selection. Brief of Short Haul Committee, at 9 - 10.
